/rp><rt>おか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Bill did not commit the crime.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おかず</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">配菜；小菜；填充音；鼓点填充；自慰的对象；色情内容</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"171262\"><ruby>今晩<rp>(</rp><rt>こんばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおかずはもう<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてあります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ve decided what to cook for dinner.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おかね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">钱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">お<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">钱不够。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">金</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お金持ち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おかねもち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">富人；有钱人；财主</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201588\">どうしたらお<ruby>金持<rp>(</rp><rt>かねも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちになれるのかしら？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How can I become rich?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お代わり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おかわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">再来一份；续杯；再添一份；换爪！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192668\">ライスとキャベツをお<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりお<ruby>願<rp>(</rp><rt>ねが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Can I have seconds on rice and cabbage?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拝む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おがむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">合掌；行礼；拜礼；向（如佛像等）表示敬礼；乞求；恳求；哀求；拜见；瞻仰（身份高的人或事物）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小川</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おがわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">小溪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">川</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外海；冲绳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207488\">その<ruby>島<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>海岸<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から１マイル<ruby>沖<rp>(</rp><rt>おき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The island lies a mile off the coast.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おきのどくに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">真遗憾；太不幸了；我很同情你</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227120\">お<ruby>姉<rp>(</rp><rt>ねえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんのことはたいへんお<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>毒<rp>(</rp><rt>どく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I feel very sorry for your sister.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">起きる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おきる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">起床；起立；燃烧；醒来；保持清醒；发生；出现</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227112\">お<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんはまだ<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きているのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Is the kid still up?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">補う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おぎなう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">补充；弥补</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>経験不足<rp>(</rp><rt>けいけんぶそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>努力<rp>(</rp><rt>どりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>補<rp>(</rp><rt>おぎな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">用