pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">室外；户外；露天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97495\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>屋外<rp>(</rp><rt>おくがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>スポーツに<ruby>熱心<rp>(</rp><rt>ねっしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They are keen on outdoor sports.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">奥さん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妻子；夫人；太太；贵夫人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188559\"><ruby>奥<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんがどこかに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かけているらしいから。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I think his wife is going out of town.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">屋上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">屋顶；楼顶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202146\">デパートの<ruby>屋上<rp>(</rp><rt>おくじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にアドバルーンが<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There is an advertising balloon flying above the department store.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">臆病</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくびょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span 